# Ghostly Dancers unlocking a door of a Room whose doors are both locked: "To unlock half of a permanent, a player chooses a locked
# half" (CR 709.5f), so Bot1 is asked, not given the left door. Bot1's Unholy Annex (cast on turn 1) is exiled by Flickerwisp on turn
# 3 and returns at that end step with neither half cast, so neither door unlocked (CR 709.5d). On turn 5 Bot1 has no enchantment card
# in its graveyard (Black Lotus is an artifact), so Ghostly Dancers can only unlock; both halves are offered and Bot1 names Ritual
# Chamber: it unlocks, "when you unlock this door" makes the 6/6 Demon (CR 709.5h), Unholy Annex stays locked and the Room is not
# fully unlocked, so eerie makes no Spirit (CR 709.5i).
# Annex's {2}{B} is Black Lotus, Mox Jet and a Mox Pearl; Flickerwisp's {1}{W}{W} the two Pearls and a Plains; the Dancers' {3}{W}{W}
# the Pearls, both Plains and Mox Jet. Annex's turn 1 end step draws Flickerwisp.

